            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Eligibility: Customers must be 18 years or older and legally eligible to participate in auctions.&#xa;&#xa;Registration: A valid account is required, and accurate personal information must be provided during registration.&#xa;&#xa;Bidding: All bids placed are binding. Once a bid is made, it cannot be retracted.&#xa;&#xa;Payment: Winning bidders must pay the full amount, including applicable fees, within the specified time.&#xa;&#xa;Item Description: Items are sold &quot;as-is&quot; with no guarantees unless explicitly stated. Customers should review item details carefully before bidding.&#xa;&#xa;Auctioneer Rights: The auctioneer reserves the right to cancel bids, withdraw items, or resolve disputes at their discretion.&#xa;&#xa;No Refunds: All sales are final. No refunds or exchanges will be provided.&#xa;&#xa;Liability: The auction system is not responsible for errors, interruptions, or issues with third-party services.&#xa;&#xa;Pickup/Delivery: Customers must arrange for item collection or delivery within the specified time frame. Shipping costs, if any, are the customer&#x2019;s responsibility.&#xa;&#xa;Prohibited Conduct: Fraudulent activities, tampering, or violating auction rules will result in disqualification and potential&#xa0;legal&#xa0;action."/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
      </SubComponents>
    </Container>
